  {
    "episode_id": 74506,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74506.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "They don't scale. I don't know anybody that's put solar panels on their house that just disconnected from energy was like, I don't need them anymore. It's like, You spend all that money to put the whole backside of your house has got all these, and I'm not trying to pick one or make fun. I'm just saying things probably that you don't want to say. So I'll say it. It's great. I'm glad you got the solar panels, man, but you're still plugged into the grid. You still need this other stuff. That's not the answer to all of",
